# Line endings are LF everywhere: in the repository and in every working tree,
# on every platform. Contributors on Windows will see LF in their editor.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Documents in this repository are Markdown. Stated explicitly so the rule
# survives any future change to the catch-all above.
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary assets, should any be added, must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
